            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenejo Edom; “Etumutaki iyiook kake kintoki aashet ineeidaaitie”; ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani: “Eidim ninche aateshet, kake kasulaki nanu enkop ometaba anaa neipoti aajo enkop e ntorroni, iltung'ana ootagorokine Olaitoriani intarasi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idolidolo ena too inkonyek inyi maate, nijojo ina kata; “Aikitok Olaitoriani negiroo enkitoo enye ilpolosien loo Siraeli!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eisikong'a Olaitoriani ilapolosak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eyanyit olayioni menye, neyanyit osinka olkitok lenye. Amaa naa tenaa kara papaai linyi, koree enkanyit ai? Naa tenaa kara olkitok, koree euriata ai? Ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani. Lo apolosak kulo oomen enkarna ai. Ijojo intae, ‘Kaji doi kinkuna tinikimenu enkarna ino?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliki intae ajoki; tinintayuyu endaa naiduruk aapik shumata olperere lo lasar lai. Nijojo sii; ‘Kaji doi kinkuna tinikindurukie ninye?’ Ajoki intae: Amaa enidamumu to lmena emisa o Laitoriani, nintemenimene sii ilkulikae meibayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 15.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amaa tinintayuyu ilasarri loo masaa modook, aime eng'oki ina sapuk? Amaa sii tinintayuyu ilasarri loo ntokitin ng'ojiniaa anaa inaamuoi, aime eng'oki ina? Entetem sii intae enchoo nena olkitok linyi, aijojo keshipakino intae anaa eisho intae omom? Ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ajoki intae teina kata, engoru omom e Nkai peyie eidim aing'urrie iyiook. Amaa teina kishooroto naing'uaa inkaik inyi, aijojo keidim aing'urrie hoo obo linyi? Ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oi te naa ketii obo linyi oidim aikeno kutuk aji peyie mikintokiki aainuaaki enkima e pesho to lperere lo lasar! Mashipakino nanu intae, ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, nemang'amaa sii olasar linyi too nkaik inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore eiteru te nkilepunoto enkolong o metabaiki endoyioroto, kitok enkarna ai too loreren pooki, ore te pooki wueji, neitayuni enkorropil te nkaraki enkarna ai, neitayuni sii ilasarri oosinya amu aikitok enkarna ai neyanyiti too loreren pooki, ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake isarkionie intae ninye pee ijojo eidurukieki emisa o Laitoriani, ore sii endaa enye nemenuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijojo intae; eng'ura sii intae eneba enauri, nikidasakiki nkineji, ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani. Kiyakiki sii intokitin naapurruno anaa ing'ojiniaa, o naamuoi, eji naa ninche kipuonunu aaitaikinye olasar! Aijojo kang'amaa ina too nkaik inyi? Ejo Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metedeki olalejani pooki ooata olkuoo supat te luaata enye, neinos olmumai ejo ekaishoru eji neitoki apolosaki Olaitoriani ina naata eleyiata. Amu ara nanu olaiguanani kitok, ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani naa keurei enkarna ai too loreren pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
